<title>INDIA: Indian September yr/yr vehicle production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian September yr/yr vehicle production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles rose in September compared to same month in 1995, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				   PRODUCTION (in units)</p>
<p>		 Sept 96   Sept 95  Apr96-Sept96  Apr95-Sept95</p>
<p>  TRUCKS	25,518    21,388    144,381	 118,880</p>
<p>  CARS	  32,791    30,923    193,440	 162,248</p>
<p>  2-WHEELERS 256,327   230,913  1,521,940     1,262,396</p>
<p>				   SALES (in units)</p>
<p>		 Sept 96   Sept 95  Apr96-Sept96  Apr95-Sept95</p>
<p>  TRUCKS	25,814    22,862    138,520	 116,433</p>
<p>  CARS	  32,991    30,771    191,623	 158,993</p>
<p>  2-WHEELERS 258,873   238,110  1,475,234     1,253,364</p>
<p>-- New Delhi Newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
